1.change setting on the web interface,using the follwoing:
https://myvpn.yultuzs.com/<subscription-token>

2. add subscription to v2rayN use the following:
https://myvpn.yultuzs.com/<subscription-token>/sub



3. steps to setup v2rayN:
  1)  add subscription grop use a name like "myVPN", and with the 
  usrl  like this:https://xxxxxxx/sub

  set update time 60 min or higher

  2) setting -> option setting -> core:basic setting -> enable "Allow connections from the LAN "


  3) use TUN mode